### Extensión "REST Client" de VS Code: clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Salud
GET {{base}}/health

### Registrar paciente
POST {{base}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Laura Gomez Rios",
  "documentId": "1001234567",
  "email": "laura.gomez@mail.com",
  "phone": "3001112233"
}

### Listar pacientes
GET {{base}}/patients

### Registrar médico
POST {{base}}/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Ricardo Herrera",
  "specialty": "Medicina General",
  "email": "ricardo.herrera@clinica.com"
}

### Listar médicos
GET {{base}}/doctors

### Programar cita
POST {{base}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 1,
  "dateTime": "2026-10-25T09:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Control general"
}

### Listar citas (filtros opcionales)
GET {{base}}/appointments?date=2026-10-25

### Consultar una cita
GET {{base}}/appointments/1

### Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/appointments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### Cancelar cita
DELETE {{base}}/appointments/1
